('used-life-fitness-treadmill-95t', 'Life Fitness Treadmill 95T', 'Life Fitness', 'life-fitness', '95T', 'cardio-equipment', 'Commercial Treadmills', 'New', 4299, 'Dallas', 'Texas', 'texas', 'Commercial', 'Full Body', 'Motorized', true, 'A club-grade Life Fitness 95T treadmill built for continuous use on a busy gym floor. Heavy-gauge frame, cushioned deck and a console that stands up to daily commercial traffic. Suitable for gyms, hotels, corporate facilities and serious home setups.', '[{"label":"Motor","value":"4.0 HP AC"},{"label":"Speed range","value":"0.5 – 14 mph"},{"label":"Incline","value":"0 – 15%"},{"label":"Running surface","value":"22\" x 60\""},{"label":"Dimensions","value":"84\" L x 34\" W x 60\" H"},{"label":"Weight","value":"418 lbs"},{"label":"Max user weight","value":"400 lbs"},{"label":"Power","value":"110V dedicated outlet"}]'::jsonb, '2-year parts warranty from the seller', 'Freight shipping nationwide, curbside or inside delivery available', '{"name":"Lone Star Fitness Supply","type":"Verified Dealer","rating":4.9,"reviews":214,"since":2014}'::jsonb, true),
