('Michael Reyes', 'Austin, TX', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/12.jpg', 5, 'Bought a full commercial rack setup for my studio. The seller was verified, the freight quote was fair, and everything arrived crated and undamaged.', 'Rogue Fitness Power Rack R-3'),
('Sarah Thompson', 'Chicago, IL', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg', 5, 'The refurbished Precor elliptical looks and runs like new. Support answered every question about the CrossRamp before I committed.', 'Precor Elliptical EFX 885'),
('James Lawson', 'Phoenix, AZ', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg', 5, 'Prices on used commercial cardio are far better than anywhere else I checked. My treadmill has run daily for four months without a single fault.', 'Life Fitness Treadmill 95T'),
('Danielle Foster', 'Miami, FL', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/18.jpg', 5, 'We kitted out a 40-room hotel gym through this marketplace. One point of contact, three sellers, delivered in the same week.', 'Life Fitness Multi Gym G7'),
