('Priya Nair', 'Seattle, WA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/68.jpg', 5, 'I run a small PT studio and needed used gear that could take abuse. The condition grading here is honest, which is rare.', null),
('Kevin O''Donnell', 'Boston, MA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/23.jpg', 5, 'Asked for a quote at 9pm and had freight costs and a delivery window by the next morning.', null),
('Monica Alvarez', 'Los Angeles, CA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/29.jpg', 5, 'The inquiry form sends your question with the exact machine details attached, so there is no back and forth about which unit you mean.', 'Matrix Exercise Bike IC7'),
('Terrence Gill', 'Houston, TX', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/41.jpg', 5, 'Second purchase. First was a leg press, this time a cable machine. Both commercial grade, both well under new price.', null),
('Hannah Brooks', 'Denver, CO', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/56.jpg', 4, 'Delivery driver used a liftgate and got the treadmill into my basement. Worth paying for inside delivery.', null),
('Marcus Webb', 'Charlotte, NC', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/76.jpg', 5, 'Good honest photos. What I saw online is what came off the truck.', null),
('Lauren Kim', 'Portland, OR', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/9.jpg', 5, 'Bought bumper plates and a barbell for a garage gym. Shipped fast, priced well.', null),
('Ethan Caldwell', 'Nashville, TN', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/65.jpg', 5, 'Our school district needed durable equipment on a tight budget. Refurbished commercial units solved it.', null),
('Rachel Underwood', 'Philadelphia, PA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/33.jpg', 5, 'Support walked me through what a 4 HP AC motor actually means for a busy gym floor. Genuinely helpful.', 'Life Fitness Treadmill 95T'),
('Jamal Carter', 'Detroit, MI', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/85.jpg', 5, 'Bought a used Hammer Strength plate loaded machine. Solid steel, minor cosmetic wear, half the new price.', null),
('Olivia Bennett', 'San Diego, CA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/52.jpg', 5, 'The apartment gym package we chose fit a small room perfectly. They advised on layout before we ordered.', null),
('Nathan Pierce', 'Kansas City, MO', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/17.jpg', 5, 'Straightforward process, no pushy sales calls. I asked, they quoted, I bought.', null),
('Grace Mitchell', 'Salt Lake City, UT', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/75.jpg', 5, 'Warranty on the refurbished bike was 90 days and they honoured a console swap without argument.', null),
('Victor Ramos', 'San Antonio, TX', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/47.jpg', 5, 'Freight shipping was cheaper than the local dealer quoted for the same machine.', null),
('Chloe Harrington', 'Raleigh, NC', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/61.jpg', 5, 'Filtering by condition and location made it easy to find gear I could inspect in person first.', null),
('Brandon Steele', 'Las Vegas, NV', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/8.jpg', 5, 'Outfitted a corporate wellness room. Everything matched, everything worked, no downtime.', null),
('Amelia Novak', 'Minneapolis, MN', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/22.jpg', 4, 'Great for used commercial cardio. My spin bikes have taken 20 classes a week since March.', null),
('Derek Sullivan', 'Tampa, FL', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/90.jpg', 5, 'Sold two treadmills through the sell form as well as buying. Both sides were simple.', null),
('Naomi Wallace', 'Columbus, OH', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/39.jpg', 5, 'The specs table on each product page is detailed enough to plan electrics and floor space.', null),
('Luis Herrera', 'El Paso, TX', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/29.jpg', 5, 'Good communication about lead time on a crated machine. It arrived exactly when promised.', null),
('Emily Dawson', 'Hartford, CT', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/5.jpg', 5, 'Bought a home multi gym. Assembly guide came with it and the cables were new.', 'Life Fitness Multi Gym G7'),
('Sean Mulligan', 'Pittsburgh, PA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/60.jpg', 5, 'Used commercial equipment outlasts home grade gear. This is where I buy it now.', null),
('Tanya Okafor', 'Newark, NJ', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/81.jpg', 5, 'Ordered accessories and free weights together and they combined the shipping.', null),
('Craig Peterson', 'Boise, ID', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/71.jpg', 5, 'Cheaper than auction sites and I actually knew who I was buying from.', null),
('Isabel Moreno', 'Albuquerque, NM', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/47.jpg', 5, 'The quote request through the cart is clever. I listed five items and got one shipping figure.', null),
('Wesley Nguyen', 'Sacramento, CA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/36.jpg', 5, 'Refurbished stair climber for my studio. Runs quiet, looks sharp.', null),
('Bethany Clarke', 'Richmond, VA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/14.jpg', 5, 'Very responsive team. Two emails and my questions on warranty and returns were answered.', null),
('Omar Haddad', 'Louisville, KY', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/50.jpg', 5, 'Bought a squat rack and bench for the garage. Great steel, fair price, fast freight.', null),
('Julia Sandoval', 'Fresno, CA', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/90.jpg', 5, 'We compared three sellers side by side on the same machine. Transparent and easy.', null),
('Patrick Doyle', 'Providence, RI', 'https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/3.jpg', 5, 'Honest condition grades, real photos and no hidden fees at checkout inquiry. I''d buy again.', 5);